2
, J = 6.5 Hz); 5.80 (d, 1H, aryl, J = 2.5 Hz); 5.87 (d, 1H, aryl, J = 6.0 Hz); 6.56
(d, 1H, aryl, J = 2.7 Hz). 13C NMR (100
MHz, CD3OD): δ: 24.4, 27.8, 28.4, 36.7, 38.9, 39.9,
48.5, 51.3, 101.6, 118.6, 123.1, 158.1. HR-MS m/z calcd for C20H32N4O [(M
+ H)]+: 345.2649; found 345.2632.

